{
	"title": "Timeline composed with the enable switch, a manual override by a reaction and a rule watching the state datapoint",
	"description": "hall: on at 08:00, off at 18:00 every day; a report of btn goes to on. watch writes mirror on every change of rule/hall/state. Boot on Monday 2026-11-16 at 07:00: off is due (Sunday 18:00), entered with its entry action; the state datapoint's load value is no event. 08:00 on (watch follows). 09:00 hall is disabled: 18:00 does not switch. 19:00 enabled again: a start with the reason enable takes the due state off with its entry action (watch follows). 20:00 btn: on by the reaction, the manual override (watch follows). Tuesday 08:00 switches to on although hall is in on: a self-transition sends again, the state datapoint is updated without a change and watch does not fire. Tuesday 18:00 off.",
